 ArrayList<JSONObject> docs=new ArrayList<>(); LinearLayout root,list; String query="",filter=CategoryCatalog.ALL; boolean favorites=false; JSONObject active; int page=0; PdfRenderer renderer; ParcelFileDescriptor descriptor; Bitmap bitmap; ImageView image;TextView pageLabel;Button prev,next; boolean busy=false;
 int dp(float v){return (int)(v*getResources().getDisplayMetrics().density+.5f);}
 public void onCreate(Bundle b){super.onCreate(b);getWindow().getDecorView().setOnApplyWindowInsetsListener((v,in)->{v.setPadding(in.getSystemWindowInsetLeft(),in.getSystemWindowInsetTop(),in.getSystemWindowInsetRight(),in.getSystemWindowInsetBottom());return in.consumeSystemWindowInsets();});try{File f=new File(getFilesDir(),"library.json");if(f.exists()){JSONArray a=new JSONArray(new String(new AtomicFile(f).readFully(),StandardCharsets.UTF_8));for(int i=0;i<a.length();i++)docs.add(a.getJSONObject(i));}}catch(Exception e){toast("อ่านคลังข้อมูลไม่ได้ กรุณาเก็บข้อมูลแอปไว้และติดต่อผู้พัฒนา");}home();UpdateChecker.check(this,false);if(b!=null){String id=b.getString("document");for(JSONObject d:docs)if(d.optString("id").equals(id)){open(d,b.getInt("page",0));break;}}}
 protected void onSaveInstanceState(Bundle b){super.onSaveInstanceState(b);if(active!=null){b.putString("document",active.optString("id"));b.putInt("page",page);}}
 boolean persist(){try{JSONArray a=new JSONArray();for(JSONObject d:docs)a.put(d);AtomicFile af=new AtomicFile(new File(getFilesDir(),"library.json"));FileOutputStream out=null;try{out=af.startWrite();out.write(a.toString().getBytes(StandardCharsets.UTF_8));af.finishWrite(out);}catch(Exception e){af.failWrite(out);throw e;}return true;}catch(Exception e){toast("บันทึกไม่ได้ กรุณาตรวจสอบพื้นที่ว่าง");return false;}}
 LinearLayout column(){LinearLayout v=new LinearLayout(this);v.setOrientation(LinearLayout.VERTICAL);return v;}
